{"id":"974d8a23a1979a0d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTyRow.md","title":"PolyTyRow","display":"PolyTyRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTyRow","parameters":["z1786","z1787","z1788"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTyRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1786</span><span>z1787</span><span>z1788</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 语法。有序参数：<code>z1786</code>、<code>z1787</code>、<code>z1788</code>。</p>\n<p>类型指标、箭头、全称类型；只有全称类型增加类型绑定深度。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTyRow z1786 z1787 z1788)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists d\n  (exists a\n    (and\n      (@ Pair d a z1788)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat d)\n        (or\n          (exists z1791 (and (in z1791 d) (@ FTV z1791 a)))\n          (or\n            (exists z1792\n              (exists z1793\n                (and\n                  (@ TArr z1792 z1793 a)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z1795\n                      (exists z1796 (and (in z1795 z1787) (and (@ App z1786 z1795 z1796) (@ Pair d z1792 z1796)))))\n                    (exists z1797\n                      (exists z1798 (and (in z1797 z1787) (and (@ App z1786 z1797 z1798) (@ Pair d z1793 z1798)))))))))\n            (exists z1792\n              (exists z1794\n                (and\n                  (@ FForall z1792 a)\n                  (and\n                    (@ Succ d z1794)\n                    (exists z1799\n                      (exists z1800 (and (in z1799 z1787) (and (@ App z1786 z1799 z1800) (@ Pair z1794 z1792 z1800)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4002d1847fb33d0\" href=\"?note=b4002d1847fb33d0\" title=\"ZFC_FForall\">FForall</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fc187922d1b1881\" href=\"?note=5fc187922d1b1881\" title=\"ZFC_FTV\">FTV</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyTyRow z1786 z1787 z1788)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FForall|FForall]]；[[ZFC_FTV|FTV]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FForall","st